  triage:title "No doctor tests for the five new codes/info counts and no recipient-store tests" ;
  triage:description "AX.6 QA-1 (quality-mgr QA-AX6-R1-1788626395, PR #1204 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T16:56Z) at head 490a6c42a0f3283c251875d9a61fcf99b641c2a2. crates/atm-core/src/doctor/mod.rs has no tests for any of the five new doctor warning codes or the assigned/active info counts; crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/task_store.rs has no tests for the escalation-recipient store (scope keying, duplicate add, daemon fallback when the team list is empty). Fix: add both test groups." ;
